  "details": "Users have requested useful types that should be added to Udon.\n\nHere are a few types that VRChat is working on adding:\n\n- [Array.Sort](https://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/arraysort)\n\n- [System.Random](https://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/expose-systemrandom)\n\n- [StringBuilder](https://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/please-expose-stringbuilder)\n\n- System.Type ([IsSubclassOf(), IsInstanceOfType(), and baseType](https://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/expose-systemtypeissubclassof-isinstanceoftype-issubclassof-and-basetype) and [GetElementType()](https://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/please-expose-systemtypegetelementtype-to-udon))",
